'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape and a [[player card]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page 2 of the [[Scope of Authority Premium Warbond#Page 2|Scope of Authority Premium Warbond]], can be claimed separately for {{Currency|Medals|25|notext}} and {{Currency|Medals|7}} respectively

